207 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 66 0 R
/E (A second experience was the excellent mentorship and camaraderie I received as a member of the RAND Statistics Group. The support I received gave me the opportunity and confidence I needed to learn how to be an applied statistician and to take on the myriad of diverse challenges and methodological issues that arose in policy research. It also taught me the importance of mentorship and supporting your team. The skills I learned from my mentors and my time at RAND are what I rely on today and the lessons I learned about leadership have guided me in the leadership positions I have had including leading the RAND Statistics Group and serving as the Associate Vice President for Psychometric Analysis and Research at ETS.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [17]
>>
endobj
208 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 66 0 R
